M's woes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128134605.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/starmers-communications-chief-resigns-adding-to-uk-pms-woes/articleshow/128134605.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/starmers-communications-chief-resigns-adding-to-uk-pms-woes/articleshow/128134605.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-10T05:05:26+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128134605,imgsize-882495.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SpaceX prioritises lunar 'self-growing city' over Mars project: Musk]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128134560.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/spacex-prioritises-lunar-self-growing-city-over-mars-project-musk/articleshow/128134560.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/spacex-prioritises-lunar-self-growing-city-over-mars-project-musk/articleshow/128134560.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-10T05:03:23+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128134560,imgsize-595798.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[China critic Jimmy Lai given 20-yr jail after landmark trial]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128134508.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Lai Was Mastermind Behind Foreign Collusion Conspiracies]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/china-critic-jimmy-lai-given-20-yr-jail-after-landmark-trial/articleshow/128134508.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/china-critic-jimmy-lai-given-20-yr-jail-after-landmark-trial/articleshow/128134508.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-10T05:00:03+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128134508,imgsize-1145162.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mysterious tunnels found beneath 5,000-year-old pagan graves in Germany leave experts stunned]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128133862.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[German archaeologists unearthed a medieval tunnel system beneath a 5,000-year-old Neolithic burial site near Reinstedt. The narrow underground passage, identified as an 'erdstall,' contained late medieval artifacts. Experts believe the medieval builders intentionally chose this ancient pagan site, possibly for its visibility or as a discreet location, raising intriguing questions about historical land use and cultural interactions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/mysterious-tunnels-found-beneath-5000-year-old-pagan-graves-in-germany-leave-experts-stunned/articleshow/128133862.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/mysterious-tunnels-found-beneath-5000-year-old-pagan-graves-in-germany-leave-experts-stunned/articleshow/128133862.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-10T04:25:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128133955,imgsize-803694.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Researchers horrified as ChatGPT generates stadium bombing plans, anthrax recipes and drug formulas]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128129378.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Safety tests in 2025 found that stripped-down versions of OpenAI’s models could generate detailed guidance for violent attacks, explosives and cybercrime when guardrails were removed. Conducted with rival Anthropic, the experiments raised alarms that AI capabilities are advancing faster than alignment and safety measures, intensifying scrutiny of whether existing safeguards can reliably prevent real-world misuse.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/researchers-horrified-as-chatgpt-generates-stadium-bombing-plans-anthrax-recipes-and-drug-formulas/articleshow/128129378.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/researchers-horrified-as-chatgpt-generates-stadium-bombing-plans-anthrax-recipes-and-drug-formulas/articleshow/128129378.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-10T04:14:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Trending Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128133111,imgsize-747259.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Elon Musk targets former Trump aide Steve Bannon over Epstein ties and rival documentary to Netflix’s ‘Filthy Rich’]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128131316.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Tech mogul Elon Musk has publicly slammed Steve Bannon, a former Trump aide, over his documented ties to Jeffrey Epstein. Musk's strong criticism, amplified by new Epstein disclosures, targets Bannon's involvement in an unreleased documentary project that aimed to portray Epstein sympathetically. This has intensified scrutiny on Bannon's past associations and sparked debate within conservative circles regarding judgment and credibility.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/elon-musk-targets-former-trump-aide-steve-bannon-over-epstein-ties-and-rival-documentary-to-netflixs-filthy-rich/articleshow/128131316.cms]]></link><guid><![