/photo/128126235.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/six-men-accused-of-seeking-sexual-services-from-minors-charged-with-human-trafficking-in-canada/articleshow/128126235.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/six-men-accused-of-seeking-sexual-services-from-minors-charged-with-human-trafficking-in-canada/articleshow/128126235.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-10T00:27:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128126235,imgsize-581494.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Epstein associate Ghislaine Maxwell declines House testimony, seeks Trump clemency]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128126584.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ghislaine Maxwell, serving a 20-year sentence for sex trafficking, refused to answer questions from a House Oversight Committee. She invoked her Fifth Amendment right, stating she would only speak if granted clemency by US President Donald Trump. Maxwell's lawyer indicated she is prepared to share "unfiltered truth" if clemency is granted.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/epstein-associate-ghislaine-maxwell-declines-house-testimony-seeks-trump-clemency/articleshow/128126584.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/epstein-associate-ghislaine-maxwell-declines-house-testimony-seeks-trump-clemency/articleshow/128126584.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-10T00:08:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128126980,imgsize-1348977.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Charles Radford: US sailor who spied on Kissinger during the 1971 India–Pakistan war]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128125392.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A young US Navy yeoman, Charles Radford, secretly copied classified documents from the National Security Council during the early 1970s. He passed these sensitive papers, including those related to Henry Kissinger's handling of the India-Pakistan war, to senior military officers. This internal spying revealed a power struggle between civilian leaders and the military, with Radford acting as the conduit.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-charles-radford-us-sailor-who-spied-on-kissinger-during-the-1971-indiapakistan-war/articleshow/128125392.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-charles-radford-us-sailor-who-spied-on-kissinger-during-the-1971-indiapakistan-war/articleshow/128125392.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-10T00:01:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128126338,imgsize-1214745.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[No more skirts? UK schools switch to unisex trousers after public complaints and length checks]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128124344.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[UK schools are ditching skirts for unisex trousers in uniforms, citing practical issues like skirt length monitoring and public complaints. This move aims to promote equality and inclusivity, reducing distinctions between genders. While some parents protest, citing a loss of choice and expression, experts debate whether this places undue responsibility on girls.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/no-more-skirts-uk-schools-switch-to-unisex-trousers-after-public-complaints-and-length-checks/articleshow/128124344.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/no-more-skirts-uk-schools-switch-to-unisex-trousers-after-public-complaints-and-length-checks/articleshow/128124344.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-09T23:06:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128124344,imgsize-50440.cms"/></item></channel></rss>